cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this data, cite it and cite the source papers for any finding that matters to your work."
type: dataset
title: "eds-findings-nosology-supplement-v0 — Ehlers-Danlos syndromes (all 2017-classification types) and hypermobility spectrum disorder"
version: "v0"
date-released: "2026-10-21"
license: CC-BY-4.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/PLACEHOLDER/eds-findings"
authors:
  - family-names: "Magennis"
    given-names: "Erin"
    orcid: "https://orcid.org/0009-0007-9013-8052"
abstract: "343 machine-extracted findings from 45 papers on Ehlers-Danlos syndromes (all 2017-classification types) and hypermobility spectrum disorder. Nosology supplement: papers PubMed indexes under EDS that the 2017-classification screen excluded (historically classified as EDS, and adjacent heritable connective-tissue disorders); every row carries scope_class; see code/NOSOLOGY.md. Well-formedness QA only; fidelity not human-adjudicated. Scientific fidelity is unmeasured."
